{"seq":1,"slug":"routing-rule-engine-strategy-model","title":"路由规则引擎与策略模型：成本、授权率、卡组织与地域决策因子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/smart-routing-failover-optimization/routing-rule-engine-strategy-model","wordCount":2846,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"路由规则引擎与策略模型-成本-授权率-卡组织与地域决策因子\">路由规则引擎与策略模型：成本、授权率、卡组织与地域决策因子</h1><p>一笔从德国买家到香港商户的 480 欧元订单，在收银台点击「支付」后的 900 毫秒内，编排层要回答一个看似简单的问题：这单走哪条通道？候选可能是 Adyen 的欧洲收单、Stripe 的英国实体、一个本地 PSP 加一个 BIN sponsor、以及一条经由 Adyen 平台的本地支付方式支线。每条通道的费率结构不同、对该 BIN 段的历史授权率不同、对 3DS 的摩擦容忍度不同。选错不会报错，只会悄悄把授权率从 92% 拉到 87%，或者把成本从 1.4% 抬到 2.1%。路由规则引擎就是把这个问题变成可解释、可回放、可迭代的工程对象的那一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-决策因子的四类坐标系\">核心概念：决策因子的四类坐标系</h2><p>路由不是「挑最便宜」，而是在一组硬约束下对多个目标做加权求解。约束与目标分布在四个互相拉扯的坐标系里，把它们混在一个 if-else 链里是绝大多数自研路由在半年后失控的根因。</p>\n<p><strong>卡组织与产品维度。</strong> Visa、Mastercard、American Express、JCB、UnionPay 各自的规则手册定义了能否做某种降级（例如原交易为信用卡却以借记通道重试）、能否复用授权、争议与拒付的阈值。Visa 的收购方监控计划（Visa Acquirer Monitoring Program, VAMP）与 Mastercard 的 Excessive Chargeback Program 都会把拒付率超限的商户整体处置，这意味着路由不能只看单笔成本，还要看它把风险累积到了哪个实体上（Visa Rules，visa.com；Mastercard Rules，mastercard.com）。</p>\n<p><strong>地域与监管维度。</strong> 欧盟的 Interchange Fee Regulation（IFR, Regulation (EU) 2015/751）把消费卡交换费上限压在借记卡 0.2%、信用卡 0.3%，所以欧洲本土通道的成本曲线和拉美「本地收单」的曲线完全不同。同时 PSD2 的强客户认证（SCA）要求决定了哪些交易必须走 3DS 挑战流，而哪些可以靠豁免（如低价值豁免、交易风险分析 TRA）跳过挑战——豁免的可用性本身就是路由的候选筛选条件（European Banking Authority，eba.europa.eu）。</p>\n<p><strong>收单实体与通道维度。</strong> 同一笔卡交易，走本地收单（local acquiring，MID 落在买家国家）通常比跨境收单（cross-border acquiring）的授权率高，因为发卡行的地域风控对「本国收单 + 本国币种」更友好。这条经验规则在多数市场成立，但代价是本地实体需要独立合规、独立清结算、独立备付金，成本结构完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>交易与商户维度。</strong> 交易币种、金额、卡种、是否首次交易、是否已存网络令牌（network token）、商户的行业 MCC 与历史争议画像，都会改变候选通道的排序。一个中等金额、持网络令牌的回头客交易，和一笔大额、新卡、跨境 B2B 交易，最优路由往往相反。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本因子-从名义费率到-有效费率\">成本因子：从名义费率到「有效费率」</h2><p>把成本当作决策因子时，第一个陷阱是把 PSP 报价的百分比当成本。真实的每笔交易成本由四段叠加，而且各段的可见性不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本段</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>可见性</th>\n<th>路由相关性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>交换费 interchange</td>\n<td>发卡行，卡组织制定</td>\n<td>对账文件中逐笔可查</td>\n<td>由卡种/地域决定，路由只影响是否走本地收单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡组织费 scheme fee</td>\n<td>Visa/Mastercard 等</td>\n<td>通常汇总可见</td>\n<td>与卡组织、产品、BIN 国家绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PSP 加价 markup</td>\n<td>收单/编排服务商</td>\n<td>合同约定</td>\n<td>路由直接可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率加价 FX markup</td>\n<td>处理币种转换的一方</td>\n<td>隐藏在汇率中</td>\n<td>跨境交易的大头，常被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>有效费率（effective rate）才是有意义的比较量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>interchange</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>scheme</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>markup</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>fx</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>volume</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{eff}}(p) = \\frac{\\sum_i \\big(\\text{interchange}_i + \\text{scheme}_i + \\text{markup}_i + \\text{fx}_i\\big)}{\\sum_i \\text{volume}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5757em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">volume</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">interchange</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scheme</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">markup</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fx</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是通道，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历该通道在观察窗口内的交易。FX 加价尤其危险：一笔结算币种与本币不同的交易，如果 PSP 的汇率价差是 1.2% 而另一家是 0.4%，在 480 欧元的订单上就是 3.8 欧元的差距，远超 markup 的差异。因此成本因子必须按月从对账数据回归出每通道的有效费率，而不是用合同报价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"授权率因子-bin-级历史-发卡行行为与卡组织差异\">授权率因子：BIN 级历史、发卡行行为与卡组织差异</h2><p>授权率不是通道的固有属性，而是 (通道, 发卡行 BIN 段, 卡种, 地域, 金额档, 3DS 结果) 的联合函数。工程上通常做分层贝叶斯式的平滑：对每个 (通道 × BIN 段) 组合维护授权率估计，样本不足时向 (通道 × 发卡行) 或 (通道 × 卡组织) 回退，避免小样本噪声把流量推到偶然高分的通道。</p>\n<p>关键的经验结构有三条：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本地收单优势</strong>随市场而异，在巴西、印度、印尼等高监管市场通常最显著，因为本地收单能进入本地清算网络并满足当地数据与结算要求。</li>\n<li><strong>卡组织间差异</strong>真实存在：同一商户、同一地域，Visa 与 Mastercard 的授权率可能相差数个百分点，且方向会随发卡行策略变化，所以不能固化成常量。</li>\n<li><strong>3DS 的双面性</strong>：强制挑战会压低完成率（弃单），但走 3DS 后授权率往往上升且拒付责任转移给发卡行。EMVCo 的 3DS 2.3 规范支持免挑战的风险决策流，路由层需要把「是否触发挑战」当作与「走哪条通道」同等的一等决策（EMVCo，emvco.com）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"规则引擎的三种形态与混合\">规则引擎的三种形态与混合</h2><p>实际生产系统几乎都是三种引擎的混合，而非单一范式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[交易入站] --&gt; B{硬约束过滤}&#10;    B --&gt;|合规/币种/卡种不支持| X[剔除候选]&#10;    B --&gt; C[候选通道集]&#10;    C --&gt; D{优先级规则层}&#10;    D --&gt;|命中 explicit rule| E[直接选定]&#10;    D --&gt;|未命中| F[加权评分层]&#10;    F --&gt; G[历史授权率&lt;br/&gt;有效费率&lt;br/&gt;3DS 摩擦&lt;br/&gt;风控画像]&#10;    G --&gt; H[排序输出 top-1]&#10;    H --&gt; I{试授权结果}&#10;    I --&gt;|成功| J[落单]&#10;    I --&gt;|硬拒绝/超时| K[故障切换 cascade]&#10;    K --&gt; C&#10;    I --&gt;|软拒绝| L[降级重试策略]\">graph TD\n    A[交易入站] --&gt; B{硬约束过滤}\n    B --&gt;|合规/币种/卡种不支持| X[剔除候选]\n    B --&gt; C[候选通道集]\n    C --&gt; D{优先级规则层}\n    D --&gt;|命中 explicit rule| E[直接选定]\n    D --&gt;|未命中| F[加权评分层]\n    F --&gt; G[历史授权率&lt;br/&gt;有效费率&lt;br/&gt;3DS 摩擦&lt;br/&gt;风控画像]\n    G --&gt; H[排序输出 top-1]\n    H --&gt; I{试授权结果}\n    I --&gt;|成功| J[落单]\n    I --&gt;|硬拒绝/超时| K[故障切换 cascade]\n    K --&gt; C\n    I --&gt;|软拒绝| L[降级重试策略]</pre><p><strong>优先级规则层</strong>处理不可让步的业务判断：某国家必须用本地实体、某卡种必须走支持分期的通道、大额交易必须走已完成 3DS 的通道。这一层用显式声明（DSL 或配置表）而非代码，才能在合规变化时由风控而非工程师修改。</p>\n<p><strong>加权评分层</strong>把多目标合成一个标量。常见形式是线性加权，但权重不该是拍脑袋的常数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>auth</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>friction</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>risk</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(p) = \\alpha \\cdot \\widehat{\\text{auth}}(p) - \\beta \\cdot c_{\\text{eff}}(p) - \\gamma \\cdot \\text{friction}(p) - \\delta \\cdot \\text{risk}(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1844em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9344em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">auth</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6944em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">friction</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">risk</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>auth</mtext><mo stretchy=\"true\">^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\widehat{\\text{auth}}(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1844em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9344em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">auth</span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.6944em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.24em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"0.24em\" viewBox=\"0 0 1062 239\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><path d=\"M529 0h5l519 115c5 1 9 5 9 10 0 1-1 2-1 3l-4 22\nc-1 5-5 9-11 9h-2L532 67 19 159h-2c-5 0-9-4-11-9l-5-22c-1-6 2-12 8-13z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该交易上下文下的条件授权率估计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{eff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是归一化后的有效费率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>friction</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{friction}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span> 编码 3DS 挑战与跳转带来的完成率损失，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>risk</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{risk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">risk</span></span></span></span></span></span> 反映拒付与合规暴露。权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 应当由「一单位授权率提升值多少成本」的业务换算推出，而不是 0.5/0.5 这类默认值。</p>\n<p><strong>学习型层</strong>（上下文老虎机或强化学习）在上层给出候选序后做探索。它能捕捉规则难以表达的交互项，但必须有冷启动保护、流量上限和可回放的决策日志——否则线上出现授权率异常时无法归因。工程上更稳的落点是：规则层负责可解释的边界，评分层负责日常择优，学习层只在少数高价值通道上做有上限的探索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障切换-把-路由-和-重试-当作同一策略\">故障切换：把「路由」和「重试」当作同一策略</h2><p>故障切换是路由策略的延续而非独立模块。当首选通道返回超时或明确的通道级错误时，级联（cascade）到次选的判断必须遵守三条纪律。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>区分拒绝类型</strong>。发卡行硬拒绝（如 stolen card、insufficient funds）不应重试，重试只会抬高拒付与卡组织风险指标；通道级错误（网关 5xx、超时、配置错误）才是级联的正当触发。混淆这两类会把授权率「刷」上去而把争议率一起抬高。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>级联不等于重发。</strong> 大多数卡组织规则要求同一笔卡交易不能简单地换通道重发而不做标记，重复授权会导致持卡人看到双笔冻结并被发卡行判定为异常。正确处理是使用卡组织提供的原交易引用（如 Visa 的原始交易标识、Mastercard 的授权引用）做关联，并在规则允许的场景下走重试。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>故障切换要有预算与熔断。</strong> 每通道维护滑动窗口的成功率与延迟，跌破阈值时自动降权但仍保留少量探测流量，避免通道恢复后长期被雪藏。这一机制与编排层的令牌化和幂等键设计强耦合，具体实现见同章的幂等与重试策略文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上线-回放与治理\">上线、回放与治理</h2><p>路由策略的每一次权重调整都会改变资金路径与合规暴露，因此发布流程必须包含三项工程保障。其一，<strong>决策日志</strong>记录每笔交易的全部候选、评分分量与最终选择，使得任意一天的授权率变化都能归因到具体因子。其二，<strong>影子与回放</strong>：新策略先在影子模式下对历史交易重算，输出「若采用会怎样」的对比，再放小比例真实流量。其三，<strong>护栏指标</strong>与业务目标并列监控——授权率、有效费率之外，还要看拒付率、3DS 触发率、每通道故障切换占比，任何一项突破卡组织阈值即触发策略回退。</p>\n<p>这套结构的价值在半年后显现：当 Visa 调整某市场费率、当某发卡行收紧某个 BIN 段、当新市场要求本地收单时，改动落在声明式的规则与权重上，而不是散落在业务代码里的条件分支。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>路由规则引擎的本质，是把「这笔交易走哪条通道」从一个散落在业务代码里的条件分支，收敛成一组显式坐标上的可求解问题：卡组织与产品规则、地域与监管约束、收单实体结构、交易与商户画像构成约束面；有效费率、条件授权率、3DS 摩擦与风险暴露构成目标面。成本必须回归到含交换费、卡组织费、加价与汇率加价的有效费率，而非合同报价；授权率必须按 (通道 × BIN 段 × 卡种 × 地域) 分层估计并做小样本平滑；故障切换必须区分硬拒绝与通道级错误，并受卡组织重试规则约束。生产系统是声明式优先级规则、加权评分与有上限学习的三层混合，其可靠性来自决策日志、影子回放与护栏指标——它们让每一次权重调整都可归因、可回退，也让人真正能回答「为什么这单走了这条路」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../payment-orchestration-psp-abstraction-model/\">收单抽象与 PSP 抽象模型</a> — 路由决策所依赖的通道抽象与统一接口</li>\n<li><a href=\"../reconciliation-fees-observability-ops/\">对账、费用与可观测性运维</a> — 有效费率与决策日志的数据来源</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路由规则引擎与策略模型：成本、授权率、卡组织与地域决策因子","id":"路由规则引擎与策略模型-成本-授权率-卡组织与地域决策因子"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：决策因子的四类坐标系","id":"核心概念-决策因子的四类坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"成本因子：从名义费率到「有效费率」","id":"成本因子-从名义费率到-有效费率"},{"level":2,"text":"授权率因子：BIN 级历史、发卡行行为与卡组织差异","id":"授权率因子-bin-级历史-发卡行行为与卡组织差异"},{"level":2,"text":"规则引擎的三种形态与混合","id":"规则引擎的三种形态与混合"},{"level":2,"text":"故障切换：把「路由」和「重试」当作同一策略","id":"故障切换-把-路由-和-重试-当作同一策略"},{"level":2,"text":"上线、回放与治理","id":"上线-回放与治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"跨 PSP 支付状态机映射与生命周期一致性对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/payment-orchestration-psp-abstraction-model/payment-lifecycle-state-mapping-consistency"},"next":{"title":"级联故障切换、重试预算与降级机制（熔断 / 兜底路由）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/smart-routing-failover-optimization/cascade-failover-retry-degradation"}}